      "formula": "\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma=-\\frac{b}{a}, \\quad \\alpha\\beta+\\beta\\gamma+\\gamma\\alpha=\\frac{c}{a}, \\quad \\alpha\\beta\\gamma=-\\frac{d}{a}",
